        <p>Security, architecture and code quality designed to UK standards — with bilingual behaviour treated as a first-class engineering concern.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bts-svc">
        <span class="bts-product-tag dev" style="margin-bottom:16px">ARABIC + ENGLISH</span>
